{"classData":[{"comment":"/**\n * @summary Hierarchical task store (`Neo.gantt.TaskStore`) for `Neo.gantt.Container`.\n * @description Extends `Neo.data.TreeStore` with {@link Neo.gantt.TaskModel} so `Neo.grid.Body` and\n * `Neo.grid.column.Tree` project the flattened visible (expanded) task hierarchy while `get(id)` resolves\n * any task in $O(1)$ across both expanded and collapsed branches. Also provides `getRangeRecords(start, end)`\n * over currently visible tasks intersecting `[start, end)`.\n * @class Neo.gantt.TaskStore\n * @extends Neo.data.TreeStore\n * @see Neo.gantt.TaskModel\n * @see Neo.gantt.Container\n */","meta":{"filename":"TaskStore.mjs","lineno":5,"columnno":0,"path":"/Users/tobiasuhlig/.gemini/antigravity/brain/1f283c86-c55b-4aa5-a291-0cbb3786c302/scratch/neo-pages-sync/src/gantt","code":{},"srcPath":"src/gantt/TaskStore.mjs"},"summary":"Hierarchical task store (`Neo.gantt.TaskStore`) for `Neo.gantt.Container`.","description":"<p>Extends <code>Neo.data.TreeStore</code> with {@link Neo.gantt.TaskModel} so <code>Neo.grid.Body</code> and\n<code>Neo.grid.column.Tree</code> project the flattened visible (expanded) task hierarchy while <code>get(id)</code> resolves\nany task in $O(1)$ across both expanded and collapsed branches. Also provides <code>getRangeRecords(start, end)</code>\nover currently visible tasks intersecting <code>[start, end)</code>.</p>\n","kind":"class","name":"TaskStore","augments":["Neo.data.TreeStore"],"see":["Neo.gantt.TaskModel","Neo.gantt.Container"],"memberof":"Neo.gantt","longname":"Neo.gantt.TaskStore","scope":"static","$longname":"Neo.gantt.TaskStore","$kind":"class","id":8947,"neoClassName":"Neo.gantt.TaskStore"},{"comment":"/**\n         * @member {String} className='Neo.gantt.TaskStore'\n         * @protected\n         */","meta":{"filename":"TaskStore.mjs","lineno":23,"columnno":8,"path":"/Users/tobiasuhlig/.gemini/antigravity/brain/1f283c86-c55b-4aa5-a291-0cbb3786c302/scratch/neo-pages-sync/src/gantt","code":{},"srcPa